⚡ GAON-NEXT-KERNEL

An Overclocked Custom Kernel for Xiaomi Redmi 6 (Cereus)

📱 About

GAON-NEXT-KERNEL is a custom kernel built specifically for the Xiaomi Redmi 6 (Cereus).

Designed with performance in mind, this kernel features CPU overclocking and GPU overclocking to push the device beyond its stock performance limits while aiming to maintain a smooth and responsive experience.

✨ Features -------
🚀 CPU Overclock
⚡  GPU Overclock
🔧 Tuneable Kernel
-------------------
📱 Designed specifically for Redmi 6 (Cereus) & Redmi 6A (Cactus) -> (6A:UNTESTED)

Features may vary depending on the kernel build.

📲 Device Compatibility
Device	Codename
Xiaomi Redmi 6	cereus
⚠️ This kernel is made for the Redmi 6 (Cereus). UNTESTED on Redmi 6A (Cactus)

📥 Installation
[Redmi 6 should use ONLY MIUI 10.4.4.0 -> 11.0.4.0 version before flashing custom recovery]
Download your desired kernel version.
Make sure you have a stable custom recovery.
Create a backup of your current boot image, and vendor.
Flash ALPS 0.4 64bit vendor -> kernel ZIP or image using the method I put in the release description.
Reboot your device.
Feel the vibe.

Note: Always check the release instructions before flashing.

⚠️ Disclaimer
Flashing a custom kernel is done at your OWN risk.
Overclocking may increase temperatures and power consumption.
Higher clock speeds may cause instability, random reboots, or reduced hardware lifespan.
Always keep a backup of your original boot image.
The developer is NOT responsible for bricked devices, data loss, or hardware damage.


